    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/fa98322860d997ffeb3b969d78afcf1a.avif?t=1753838808\" width=616 height=84 /></span><strong>Get overpowered and destroy waves of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors25 is about getting progressively stronger as you build your defenses. Fill your screen with rockets, lightning and explosions as you create your powerups and see the damage rising! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.poster.avif?t=1753838808\" width=680 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.webm?t=1753838808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.mp4?t=1753838808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Doors25, we tried to take the elements that made you feel strong, while giving the player a variety of options that they can choose to grow. Build. Upgrade. Create! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to protect your pc long enough? Will you try to obliterate your enemies as quick as you can, ou will you try to slow them down to a halt? Each new wave comes with increasing enemies and increasing strength, so prove that you can become even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique towersDevelop your own powerupsSurvive the virus onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A life-enriching experience (probably) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are planning to release Early Acess somewhere in 2025 ;D</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/fa98322860d997ffeb3b969d78afcf1a.avif?t=1753838808\" width=616 height=84 /></span><strong>Get overpowered and destroy waves of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors25 is about getting progressively stronger as you build your defenses. Fill your screen with rockets, lightning and explosions as you create your powerups and see the damage rising! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.poster.avif?t=1753838808\" width=680 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.webm?t=1753838808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601790/extras/7f9c6f53a61663360fdc8f00a546d512.mp4?t=1753838808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Doors25, we tried to take the elements that made you feel strong, while giving the player a variety of options that they can choose to grow. Build. Upgrade. Create! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to protect your pc long enough? Will you try to obliterate your enemies as quick as you can, ou will you try to slow them down to a halt? Each new wave comes with increasing enemies and increasing strength, so prove that you can become even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique towersDevelop your own powerupsSurvive the virus onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A life-enriching experience (probably) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are planning to release Early Acess somewhere in 2025 ;D</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Protect your computer from an incoming swarm of viruses. Build and upgrade towers made from everyday life objects. Develop your own powerups to strengthen yourself!",
